{% block content %}
<div class="bio-container">
    <div class="bio-body">

        <h2>Privacy</h2>

        <p class="privacy-updated">Last updated: 22 September 2026</p>

        <h3>Who is responsible</h3>
        <p>This site, <strong>moavis.nexus</strong>, is published by Seonyx, which is the data
        controller for the limited processing described here. You can reach us through the
        contact form at <a href="https://seonyx.com/contact" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">seonyx.com/contact</a>.</p>

        <h3>The short version</h3>
        <p>This is a static website. It sets no cookies, it has no accounts, no logins, no
        comment system and no forms. Nothing you do here is tied to you as an individual, and
        nothing is used to track you across other websites. Everything the page needs
        in order to display is served from this site, apart from the analytics described
        below.</p>

        <h3>Cookies</h3>
        <p>This site sets no cookies and stores nothing on your device for its own purposes.
        There is no consent banner because there is nothing to consent to. The search box works
        entirely inside your browser and sends no queries to us.</p>

        <h3>Analytics</h3>
        <p>We use Cloudflare Web Analytics to see roughly how many people visit and which pages
        are read. It is cookieless, it does not fingerprint your device, and it does not follow
        you to other sites. What we see is aggregated counts, not individuals.</p>

        <h3>Hosting and server logs</h3>
        <p>The site is hosted on Cloudflare Pages. Like any web host, Cloudflare processes your
        IP address and browser details in order to deliver pages to you and to protect the site
        from attack and abuse. The lawful basis for this is our legitimate interest in running a
        working, secure website. Cloudflare's own privacy notice covers what it does with that
        data.</p>

        <h3>Fonts</h3>
        <p>Page type is served from this site. Your browser fetches no fonts from anyone else,
        so rendering these pages sends nothing to a third party.</p>

        <h3>Links to other places</h3>
        <p>Pages here link out to Amazon, Substack, Discord, Bluesky, Mastodon, X, Threads,
        Facebook, Instagram, TikTok, YouTube and Medium. Following a link takes you to a service
        we do not run, with its own privacy policy and its own cookies. The share buttons on blog
        posts are plain links: nothing is sent anywhere until you click one, and no social network
        code runs on this site.</p>

        <h3>What we do not do</h3>
        <p>We do not collect names or email addresses through this site, build profiles, run
        advertising, sell or share data with anyone for their own purposes, or use automated
        decision making.</p>

        <h3>Your rights</h3>
        <p>Where we hold personal data about you, you have the right to ask what we have, to have
        it corrected or erased, to object to or restrict how it is used, and to receive a copy.
        These requests are free. Realistically, because this site keeps no records that identify
        you, there is usually nothing for us to return beyond what is written here. Ask us anyway
        if you want to check.</p>

        <p>If you are unhappy with how we have handled your data, you can complain to the Spanish
        data protection authority, the Agencia Española de Protección de Datos, at
        <a href="https://www.aepd.es/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">aepd.es</a>.</p>

        <h3>Changes</h3>
        <p>If this notice changes, the date at the top changes with it.</p>

    </div>
</div>
